Package: com.twoyears666.virtuallinux
Name: Virtual Linux
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Run Linux virtual machines on jailbroken iPadOS and iOS.
 Uses the hardware virtualization stack that still exists in the XNU kernel
 of iPadOS 14.0 up to 16.3.1. Apple removed Hypervisor support in 16.4, so
 this package refuses to run on newer systems.
Maintainer: twoyears666
Author: twoyears666
Section: Utilities
Priority: optional
Depends: firmware (>= 14.0), firmware (<< 16.4)
Tag: role::enduser
